1
00:01:27,861 --> 00:01:33,089
[Adapted from Che Ye Liu Xiang's
novel of the same name]

2
00:01:33,089 --> 00:01:37,791
[Episode 7]

3
00:01:45,041 --> 00:01:46,416
Is the Cloud Palace really that big?

4
00:01:46,416 --> 00:01:48,500
What time did people
have to start work back then?

5
00:01:48,500 --> 00:01:51,166
That's why you don't have to envy
the noblemen of the past.

6
00:01:51,166 --> 00:01:52,291
They all had it hard.

7
00:01:52,291 --> 00:01:54,500
Lv Qing is so knowledgeable.

8
00:01:54,500 --> 00:01:55,874
Everything is ready.

9
00:01:55,874 --> 00:01:56,875
Come and eat.

10
00:01:56,875 --> 00:01:58,750
Didn't you say you wanted
sugar-fried dough cakes?

11
00:01:58,750 --> 00:02:01,541
Second Big Bro, Big Bro Lv Qing said
he'd take me to the Cloud Palace.

12
00:02:01,541 --> 00:02:04,601
He wants to show me
where the princesses and concubines lived.

13
00:02:06,750 --> 00:02:08,083
Big Bro Lv Qing is very busy.

14
00:02:08,083 --> 00:02:09,583
He doesn't have time for you.

15
00:02:09,583 --> 00:02:10,833
I'll take you guys instead.

16
00:02:10,833 --> 00:02:12,000
I don't want you to come.

17
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:13,166
I've already agreed with Big Bro Lv Qing.

18
00:02:13,166 --> 00:02:14,886
Only the two of us are going.

19
00:02:15,541 --> 00:02:16,541
Mom.

20
00:02:16,541 --> 00:02:18,791
- Look at her.
- It's fine.

21
00:02:18,791 --> 00:02:21,500
Since they've agreed, just let them go.

22
00:02:34,416 --> 00:02:35,538
Big Bro.

23
00:02:36,208 --> 00:02:37,916
<i>Are Mom and Dad having a good time?</i>

24
00:02:37,916 --> 00:02:39,125
Yes.

25
00:02:39,125 --> 00:02:40,416
Big Bro.

26
00:02:40,416 --> 00:02:43,416
Did you really promise
to take Xiao De to the Cloud Palace?

27
00:02:43,416 --> 00:02:45,916
<i>Yes. She's the one who wants me to take her.</i>

28
00:02:45,916 --> 00:02:47,250
<i>Why don't you take her later?</i>

29
00:02:47,250 --> 00:02:50,208
Sure. Okay.

30
00:02:50,208 --> 00:02:52,055
It's fine.

31
00:02:57,166 --> 00:02:59,457
Where did such a small phone come from?

32
00:02:59,457 --> 00:03:01,583
Big Bro Lv Qing bought it abroad.

33
00:03:01,583 --> 00:03:02,958
He accidentally broke it...

34
00:03:02,958 --> 00:03:04,083
so he gave it to me.

35
00:03:04,083 --> 00:03:06,125
I just took it to be repaired.

36
00:03:06,125 --> 00:03:07,957
See, Mom? I told you.

37
00:03:07,957 --> 00:03:09,000
The Bei family is really rich.

38
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:10,375
A little thing like this...

39
00:03:10,375 --> 00:03:12,291
probably costs tens of thousands.

40
00:03:12,291 --> 00:03:14,166
It's not that expensive.

41
00:03:16,874 --> 00:03:18,333
For our job...

42
00:03:18,333 --> 00:03:21,083
we usually run around
the villages and countryside.

43
00:03:21,083 --> 00:03:23,999
Sometimes we walk two miles
just to make a phone call.

44
00:03:23,999 --> 00:03:25,042
We're not like you, Fan Fan.

45
00:03:25,042 --> 00:03:28,495
You sit in an office
handling slips and shipping goods.

46
00:03:29,791 --> 00:03:32,708
It'd be so convenient if I had this phone.

47
00:03:32,708 --> 00:03:33,833
Stop being so pathetic.

48
00:03:33,833 --> 00:03:36,083
You're envious of everything your brother has.

49
00:03:36,083 --> 00:03:37,500
No, Mom, I'm serious.

50
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:39,333
Sometimes when we're doing promotions,

51
00:03:39,333 --> 00:03:41,125
we need to report to the leaders at any time.

52
00:03:41,125 --> 00:03:43,208
If we misunderstand some policy or other,

53
00:03:43,208 --> 00:03:45,256
at best, you lose your job.

54
00:03:45,256 --> 00:03:48,084
At worst... well, it's hard to say.

55
00:03:50,000 --> 00:03:53,291
Maintaining good relations
with leaders is indeed important.

56
00:03:53,291 --> 00:03:55,166
Xiao Fan, if you don't really need it,

57
00:03:55,166 --> 00:03:57,333
why don't you give it to your brother?

58
00:03:59,291 --> 00:04:01,541
But this phone belongs to Lv Qing.

59
00:04:01,541 --> 00:04:02,846
Didn't Lv Qing give it to you?

60
00:04:02,846 --> 00:04:04,083
He won't care what you do with it.

61
00:04:04,083 --> 00:04:07,083
Just consider it as your brother
buying it from you in installments.

62
00:04:07,083 --> 00:04:08,375
We're all family.

63
00:04:08,375 --> 00:04:09,750
What's the point of "yours" and "mine"?

64
00:04:09,750 --> 00:04:11,500
When you can afford it later,

65
00:04:11,500 --> 00:04:14,875
just buy a new one and return it to Fan Fan.

66
00:04:14,875 --> 00:04:16,708
Give me back my phone.

67
00:04:16,708 --> 00:04:18,125
Didn't Lv Qing give it to you anyway?

68
00:04:18,125 --> 00:04:19,875
Why are you being so stingy?

69
00:04:19,875 --> 00:04:21,500
Let me tell you, a thing like this...

70
00:04:21,500 --> 00:04:23,416
is pocket change for Lv Qing.

71
00:04:23,416 --> 00:04:24,833
It's so easy for him to give you one.

72
00:04:24,833 --> 00:04:27,083
Can't you support your brother's work?

73
00:04:27,083 --> 00:04:29,333
Ping Ping, give the phone back to Fan Fan.

74
00:04:29,333 --> 00:04:31,125
It's his. He'll give it to you if he wants.

75
00:04:31,125 --> 00:04:32,708
If he doesn't want to, you can't just take it.

76
00:04:32,708 --> 00:04:34,125
Are you some kind of bandit?

77
00:04:34,125 --> 00:04:35,416
And you too, Old Lu.

78
00:04:35,416 --> 00:04:38,333
It's Xiao Fan's property.
How can you just decide to give it away?

79
00:04:39,750 --> 00:04:42,291
Fan Fan just uses the phone for fun.

80
00:04:42,291 --> 00:04:44,208
Ping Ping needs it for work.

81
00:04:44,208 --> 00:04:46,708
What's wrong with my logic?

82
00:04:56,041 --> 00:04:57,042
Hello? Who is this?

83
00:04:57,042 --> 00:04:58,958
<i>Why do you have Xiao Fan's phone?</i>

84
00:04:58,958 --> 00:05:00,791
It's Lv Qing.

85
00:05:00,791 --> 00:05:02,208
Give me back my phone.

86
00:05:02,208 --> 00:05:03,958
Look at how stingy you are.

87
00:05:03,958 --> 00:05:06,208
- Big Bro.
<i>- Did Lu Xiao Ping snatch the phone away?</i>

88
00:05:06,208 --> 00:05:09,749
I didn't let him snatch it.

89
00:05:09,749 --> 00:05:11,416
<i>You'd better not have.</i>

90
00:05:11,416 --> 00:05:14,541
<i>If Lu Xiao Ping takes that phone today,</i>

91
00:05:14,541 --> 00:05:17,750
<i>then tomorrow,
I'll make sure he's gone for good.</i>

92
00:05:17,750 --> 00:05:20,541
Ping Ping was just joking.

93
00:05:20,541 --> 00:05:22,541
He wouldn't really take my phone.

94
00:05:23,166 --> 00:05:24,166
Big Bro.

95
00:05:24,166 --> 00:05:27,083
Was there anything else you called for?

96
00:05:27,083 --> 00:05:29,750
<i>I was going to ask if you wanted
to have dinner together.</i>

97
00:05:29,750 --> 00:05:31,625
No, it's okay.

98
00:05:31,625 --> 00:05:34,541
I've already told Lv Xin that I'll eat at home.

99
00:05:34,541 --> 00:05:36,103
<i>Forget it then.</i>

100
00:05:38,083 --> 00:05:40,500
Lv Qing isn't angry, is he?

101
00:05:40,500 --> 00:05:41,708
No.

102
00:05:41,708 --> 00:05:42,708
Mom.

103
00:05:42,708 --> 00:05:46,541
But I really can't
give this phone to Ping Ping.

104
00:05:47,166 --> 00:05:48,166
I know.

105
00:05:48,166 --> 00:05:49,791
Your brother wants everything he sees.

106
00:05:49,791 --> 00:05:51,541
Don't do this again.

107
00:05:51,541 --> 00:05:54,000
Fine. I'm like the guy
who didn't get the mutton

108
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,583
but ended up smelling like it.

109
00:05:55,583 --> 00:05:58,083
Why are you brothers being so calculative?

110
00:05:58,833 --> 00:06:00,416
Since he married into the Bei family,

111
00:06:00,416 --> 00:06:03,041
he's become real brothers with Bei Lv Qing.

112
00:06:09,291 --> 00:06:10,416
You old geezer.

113
00:06:10,416 --> 00:06:12,125
What do you want?

114
00:06:12,125 --> 00:06:14,750
Back home, you were the one
who insisted on Yunjing.

115
00:06:14,750 --> 00:06:17,541
Now that we're here, you're acting weird.

116
00:06:17,541 --> 00:06:21,083
We're here because
Xiao Fan took leave to take us out.

117
00:06:21,083 --> 00:06:22,583
Look at you.

118
00:06:22,583 --> 00:06:24,375
You've been scowling all day.

119
00:06:24,375 --> 00:06:26,458
Who are you doing that for?

120
00:06:26,458 --> 00:06:27,833
It's our first time in Yunjing.

121
00:06:27,833 --> 00:06:29,333
From start to finish,

122
00:06:29,333 --> 00:06:31,500
he's always siding with outsiders.

123
00:06:32,125 --> 00:06:33,333
Xiao Fan doesn't owe our family anything.

124
00:06:33,333 --> 00:06:34,903
Think about it.

125
00:06:35,791 --> 00:06:37,625
By the way, Dad.

126
00:06:37,625 --> 00:06:40,373
We haven't had roast duck yet, right?

127
00:06:40,373 --> 00:06:41,375
That's right, Dad.

128
00:06:41,375 --> 00:06:43,541
It's a famous dish here in Yunjing.

129
00:06:43,541 --> 00:06:44,708
If you don't try it,

130
00:06:44,708 --> 00:06:47,208
people back home won't believe you came.

131
00:06:47,208 --> 00:06:49,625
What's so special about a duck?

132
00:06:49,625 --> 00:06:52,416
Even a countryman like me has had duck.

133
00:06:52,416 --> 00:06:54,416
Dad, it's really different.

134
00:06:54,416 --> 00:06:56,375
In the Bei family, they eat the skin.

135
00:06:56,375 --> 00:06:57,708
They don't even care for the meat.

136
00:06:57,708 --> 00:06:59,916
The skin is golden and crispy.

137
00:07:02,708 --> 00:07:03,708
Let's eat it.

138
00:07:04,416 --> 00:07:05,958
The kids are just being filial.

139
00:07:05,958 --> 00:07:08,125
If you won't eat, I will.

140
00:07:08,125 --> 00:07:09,125
Let's go.

141
00:07:13,333 --> 00:07:14,500
You're finally here.

142
00:07:14,500 --> 00:07:17,208
Are there any private rooms left?

143
00:07:17,208 --> 00:07:19,083
Others might not get one, but you will.

144
00:07:19,083 --> 00:07:21,333
Don't worry, it's all arranged.

145
00:07:21,333 --> 00:07:23,519
I'll take you to the private room now.

146
00:07:36,208 --> 00:07:38,528
Dad. Look at this.

147
00:07:40,416 --> 00:07:42,862
Come. Put it here.

148
00:07:43,875 --> 00:07:45,916
I haven't even ordered yet.

149
00:07:46,541 --> 00:07:48,500
This is much classier than the Bei family's.

150
00:07:48,500 --> 00:07:49,541
The Bei family's style is Western.

151
00:07:49,541 --> 00:07:51,708
This is Chinese style. It's different.

152
00:07:51,708 --> 00:07:53,247
- Eat up.
- This is delicious, Dad.

153
00:07:53,247 --> 00:07:55,554
Why is it so noisy in this room?

154
00:07:58,625 --> 00:08:00,041
Big Bro Lv Qing.

155
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:03,315
Big Bro.

156
00:08:04,916 --> 00:08:06,041
I see.

157
00:08:06,041 --> 00:08:08,000
No wonder you chose this place to treat me.

158
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:09,500
It turns out you have other guests.

159
00:08:09,500 --> 00:08:11,416
Treating me was just an afterthought.

160
00:08:11,416 --> 00:08:13,333
Lv Qing! Come, come!

161
00:08:13,333 --> 00:08:14,951
Come and sit down.

162
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:17,466
Let's go in.

163
00:08:20,708 --> 00:08:22,981
Waiter, two more sets of cutlery.

164
00:08:29,583 --> 00:08:30,625
Xiao Fan.

165
00:08:30,625 --> 00:08:32,500
Didn't you say you were eating at home?

166
00:08:33,250 --> 00:08:36,000
I realized I'd never
brought Dad for roast duck.

167
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,500
So, we came here.

168
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:41,541
I was wondering...

169
00:08:41,541 --> 00:08:44,500
Why the manager said
I was late as soon as he saw me.

170
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:46,166
It turns out you booked the room in advance.

171
00:08:46,166 --> 00:08:47,449
Thank you.

172
00:08:48,208 --> 00:08:49,500
I'm so sorry.

173
00:08:49,500 --> 00:08:50,750
We're disturbing you.

174
00:08:50,750 --> 00:08:51,750
How about this?

175
00:08:51,750 --> 00:08:54,791
I'll ask the manager for another room.

176
00:08:55,791 --> 00:08:56,916
Why go through the trouble?

177
00:08:56,916 --> 00:08:59,375
This room was originally booked for you.

178
00:08:59,375 --> 00:09:01,208
I've ordered dishes that can't be canceled.

179
00:09:01,208 --> 00:09:02,541
You said you weren't coming when I called.

180
00:09:02,541 --> 00:09:03,988
That's why I brought them here.

181
00:09:04,791 --> 00:09:06,750
Since you're all here, let's just eat together.

182
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:08,125
Don't let it go to waste.

183
00:09:08,125 --> 00:09:09,125
Please don't mind him.

184
00:09:09,125 --> 00:09:11,375
My younger brother is just introverted.

185
00:09:11,375 --> 00:09:14,833
Around strangers, he gets shy easily.

186
00:09:14,833 --> 00:09:17,708
Xiao Fan and I are old friends.

187
00:09:17,708 --> 00:09:19,375
We're not strangers.

188
00:09:19,375 --> 00:09:22,000
Oh, is that so?
Then Xiao Fan's friend is my friend.

189
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:24,019
Come, let me toast you.

190
00:09:35,166 --> 00:09:36,291
Bro.

191
00:09:36,291 --> 00:09:37,708
What do you do for a living?

192
00:09:37,708 --> 00:09:40,000
I'm in the securities business in Gangcheng.

193
00:09:41,083 --> 00:09:42,916
Then securities in Gangcheng...

194
00:09:42,916 --> 00:09:45,791
must be much more exciting
than in the mainland, right?

195
00:09:45,791 --> 00:09:47,531
Come, another toast to you.

196
00:09:57,541 --> 00:09:59,625
Did you have a good time today?

197
00:10:01,208 --> 00:10:03,666
Yes, it was... it was good.

198
00:10:09,916 --> 00:10:13,500
Bro, I'll come to you for advice
on securities from now on.

199
00:10:13,500 --> 00:10:15,003
Bottoms up.

200
00:10:19,083 --> 00:10:20,166
Come on.

201
00:10:20,166 --> 00:10:21,375
Everyone, have some food.

202
00:10:21,375 --> 00:10:23,333
Don't just drink.

203
00:10:23,333 --> 00:10:26,000
Dad, Mom, please eat.

204
00:10:26,916 --> 00:10:28,708
- Don't help me.
- This is so embarrassing.

205
00:10:28,708 --> 00:10:30,416
Oh dear.

206
00:10:30,416 --> 00:10:32,153
Oh dear.

207
00:10:44,041 --> 00:10:45,041
Big Bro.

208
00:10:45,666 --> 00:10:47,291
I'm so sorry about today.

209
00:10:53,541 --> 00:10:57,503
If you have things to do,
you should head out first.

210
00:11:26,041 --> 00:11:27,375
Big Bro.

211
00:11:27,375 --> 00:11:28,933
Where is Big Bro Lv Qing?

212
00:11:29,750 --> 00:11:31,158
He left.

213
00:11:33,375 --> 00:11:34,791
He's gone?

214
00:11:34,791 --> 00:11:37,318
Is he still taking me to Cloud Palace tomorrow?

215
00:11:38,750 --> 00:11:39,875
Don't be childish.

216
00:11:39,875 --> 00:11:42,125
Lv Qing is very busy.

217
00:11:42,125 --> 00:11:44,708
I think our brother upset him.

218
00:11:44,708 --> 00:11:47,041
Big Bro Lv Qing isn't the type
to break his word.

219
00:11:48,041 --> 00:11:49,375
Go and check on your brother.

220
00:11:49,375 --> 00:11:51,625
A young girl like you have no shame.

221
00:11:55,375 --> 00:11:57,456
You can't keep a grown daughter at home.

222
00:12:02,333 --> 00:12:03,625
Fan Fan.

223
00:12:04,375 --> 00:12:06,077
Come sit by Mom.

224
00:12:17,291 --> 00:12:19,125
Fan Fan.

225
00:12:19,125 --> 00:12:20,500
It's Mom's fault.

226
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:22,541
I've made you suffer.

227
00:12:22,541 --> 00:12:23,875
That's not true.

228
00:12:23,875 --> 00:12:25,333
Mom.

229
00:12:25,333 --> 00:12:27,454
Everything is fine for me here.

230
00:12:28,125 --> 00:12:31,916
Actually, when I had you
marry into their family,

231
00:12:31,916 --> 00:12:33,125
I hoped that one day,

232
00:12:33,125 --> 00:12:34,958
I could use you as a lifeline

233
00:12:34,958 --> 00:12:36,916
to pull all your siblings...

234
00:12:36,916 --> 00:12:40,291
and pull you all out of
that muddy pit we live in.

235
00:12:40,291 --> 00:12:42,375
I originally wanted your elder brother to go.

236
00:12:42,375 --> 00:12:44,041
He's the eldest in the family.

237
00:12:44,041 --> 00:12:46,079
It should have been his duty.

238
00:12:46,875 --> 00:12:50,029
But they happened to pick you.

239
00:12:51,500 --> 00:12:54,541
Thinking back, it's lucky it was you.

240
00:12:54,541 --> 00:12:56,208
You can endure hardships,

241
00:12:56,208 --> 00:12:58,083
and you get along with people easily.

242
00:12:58,083 --> 00:13:01,589
Unlike your brother,
who has such high aspirations.

243
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,422
Actually...

244
00:13:07,083 --> 00:13:10,158
I came this time for your sister.

245
00:13:11,375 --> 00:13:13,416
She's reached the age to get married.

246
00:13:13,416 --> 00:13:15,166
Because of our connection to the city,

247
00:13:15,166 --> 00:13:16,708
she looks down on everyone in the village.

248
00:13:16,708 --> 00:13:18,750
She's stuck in limbo.

249
00:13:18,750 --> 00:13:20,541
If her situation isn't resolved,

250
00:13:20,541 --> 00:13:23,021
she'll be a big burden for you later.

251
00:13:24,416 --> 00:13:27,541
I was thinking, could you help ask around?

252
00:13:27,541 --> 00:13:30,291
Is there any family in the city
looking for a daughter-in-law?

253
00:13:30,291 --> 00:13:31,916
Someone willing to marry Xiao De.

254
00:13:31,916 --> 00:13:34,208
We don't expect them to be wealthy.

255
00:13:34,208 --> 00:13:36,500
Just an ordinary family will do.

256
00:13:36,500 --> 00:13:38,683
As long as they don't mistreat her.

257
00:13:42,208 --> 00:13:43,916
Is there anything else?

258
00:13:43,916 --> 00:13:46,125
I think Lv Qing and Xiao De...

259
00:13:46,125 --> 00:13:48,208
get along quite well, don't they?

260
00:13:48,208 --> 00:13:51,916
Lv Qing has always been good to her.

261
00:13:51,916 --> 00:13:53,333
Didn't you say before

262
00:13:53,333 --> 00:13:56,916
that Lv Qing might have
a little interest in Xiao De?

263
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,541
Fan Fan.

264
00:14:00,541 --> 00:14:02,875
I'm not insisting it has to be Lv Qing.

265
00:14:02,875 --> 00:14:05,166
I just want you to help ask him

266
00:14:05,166 --> 00:14:07,791
if he really has feelings for your sister.

267
00:14:07,791 --> 00:14:11,166
Women marry up, and men marry down.

268
00:14:11,166 --> 00:14:14,833
It's common for the woman's status
to be lower than the man's.

269
00:14:21,083 --> 00:14:24,041
If he's not interested, we won't force it.

270
00:14:24,041 --> 00:14:26,766
Just help ask if there are other families.

271
00:14:27,541 --> 00:14:28,884
Mom.

272
00:14:31,208 --> 00:14:33,558
I understand what you mean.

273
00:14:37,541 --> 00:14:40,416
Then, when we go back this time,

274
00:14:40,416 --> 00:14:43,125
we want to leave your sister here
for a few more days.

275
00:14:43,125 --> 00:14:46,446
They need more time together
to see if it works.

276
00:14:47,541 --> 00:14:49,153
In your dreams!

277
00:14:52,166 --> 00:14:53,551
Lv Xin.

278
00:14:54,875 --> 00:14:56,438
You're home.

279
00:14:58,166 --> 00:15:01,418
Please get your family
out of my house right now.

280
00:15:02,375 --> 00:15:05,408
Lv Xin, we were just joking.

281
00:15:07,333 --> 00:15:09,166
Joking?

282
00:15:09,166 --> 00:15:11,375
Well, I'm being serious.

283
00:15:11,375 --> 00:15:12,708
Please leave immediately.

284
00:15:12,708 --> 00:15:14,625
And don't ever come back to the Bei house.

285
00:15:14,625 --> 00:15:16,750
You're kicking us out now?

286
00:15:16,750 --> 00:15:19,375
Who was it that came to our house
to propose back then?

287
00:15:19,375 --> 00:15:21,572
Who was it that wanted to
marry into our family?

288
00:15:23,208 --> 00:15:25,041
You feel wronged?

289
00:15:26,041 --> 00:15:28,500
If you felt so wronged,
you shouldn't have gotten married.

290
00:15:28,500 --> 00:15:30,101
Who forced you?

291
00:15:31,875 --> 00:15:34,875
You've gained plenty of benefits
from this marriage, haven't you?

292
00:15:34,875 --> 00:15:38,333
Otherwise, how could
all the trash in your family

293
00:15:38,333 --> 00:15:40,585
squeeze their way into Yunjing?

294
00:15:43,166 --> 00:15:45,291
Who are you calling trash?

295
00:15:45,291 --> 00:15:46,833
Who am I calling trash?

296
00:15:46,833 --> 00:15:48,708
I'm calling whoever is trash, trash.

297
00:15:48,708 --> 00:15:50,875
I'm calling out those shameless trash

298
00:15:50,875 --> 00:15:53,875
who don't even look in the mirror.

299
00:15:53,875 --> 00:15:56,999
I knew I shouldn't have
agreed to a loose woman like you.

300
00:15:56,999 --> 00:15:59,000
You were pregnant with a bastard
before you even married in.

301
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:01,625
You're the shameless one,
yet you dare call others that.

302
00:16:01,625 --> 00:16:03,156
Zhen Xing!

303
00:16:05,541 --> 00:16:07,541
That's right.

304
00:16:07,541 --> 00:16:10,375
I was pregnant and looking for a scapegoat.

305
00:16:10,375 --> 00:16:13,500
But it takes two hands to clap,
and someone willing to sell their son.

306
00:16:14,541 --> 00:16:17,208
I'm shameless for marrying
while pregnant, am I?

307
00:16:17,208 --> 00:16:19,208
You knew I was carrying someone else's seed,

308
00:16:19,208 --> 00:16:20,708
yet you still sold your son to me.

309
00:16:20,708 --> 00:16:23,500
I'm giving the word "shameless"
right back to you.

310
00:16:24,291 --> 00:16:25,375
- You...
- Zhen Xing!

311
00:16:25,375 --> 00:16:27,291
Zhen Xing! Zhen Xing!

312
00:16:27,291 --> 00:16:28,625
Big Bro!

313
00:16:28,625 --> 00:16:30,541
Big Bro! Why aren't you beating your wife yet?

314
00:16:30,541 --> 00:16:32,500
Look at how she's talking to our mom.

315
00:16:32,500 --> 00:16:34,208
Beat me?

316
00:16:34,208 --> 00:16:36,791
I wouldn't even want your brother
as a doorman in my house.

317
00:16:36,791 --> 00:16:39,375
Do you know why I haven't kicked him out?

318
00:16:39,375 --> 00:16:42,541
It's because I, Bei Lv Xin, never burn bridges.

319
00:16:42,541 --> 00:16:44,083
What are you acting so smug for?

320
00:16:44,083 --> 00:16:46,208
Do you really think you're a relative of mine?

321
00:16:46,208 --> 00:16:47,791
Get out now!

322
00:16:47,791 --> 00:16:49,166
You loose woman!

323
00:16:49,166 --> 00:16:51,333
Get out of here!

324
00:16:58,458 --> 00:17:00,625
I'll kill you! I'll kill you!

325
00:17:18,208 --> 00:17:20,041
Everyone, stop it!

326
00:17:20,708 --> 00:17:22,558
Stop it!

327
00:17:41,125 --> 00:17:42,750
Mom.

328
00:17:42,750 --> 00:17:44,102
Dad.

329
00:17:45,208 --> 00:17:47,456
I'll take you home now.

330
00:18:13,750 --> 00:18:14,875
Big Bro.

331
00:18:14,875 --> 00:18:16,125
<i>Hello?</i>

332
00:18:16,125 --> 00:18:17,565
<i>Who is it?</i>

333
00:18:38,956 --> 00:18:40,414
<i>Lv Xin.</i>

334
00:18:40,414 --> 00:18:44,861
<i>For so long, we've been living separate lives.</i>

335
00:18:44,861 --> 00:18:47,571
<i>We're far from being a married couple.</i>

336
00:19:09,322 --> 00:19:11,643
<i>Actually, when I had you
marry into their family,</i>

337
00:19:11,643 --> 00:19:12,684
<i>I hoped that one day,</i>

338
00:19:12,684 --> 00:19:14,672
<i>I could use you as a lifeline</i>

339
00:19:14,672 --> 00:19:16,363
<i>to pull all your siblings...</i>

340
00:19:16,363 --> 00:19:19,544
<i>and pull you all out of
that muddy pit we live in.</i>

341
00:19:23,082 --> 00:19:27,648
<i>Lv Xin, don't blame my parents.</i>

342
00:19:27,648 --> 00:19:31,085
<i>My presence has bothered everyone.</i>

343
00:19:33,269 --> 00:19:37,493
<i>Xiao Fan, I'm going to stay here
with Lv Qing for a while.</i>

344
00:19:37,493 --> 00:19:41,479
<i>So... I'm afraid you'll have to move out.</i>

345
00:19:41,479 --> 00:19:46,039
<i>Lv Xin, let's get a divorce.</i>

346
00:19:46,039 --> 00:19:50,362
<i>The reason would be incompatible personalities.</i>

347
00:19:50,362 --> 00:19:54,087
<i>Let's split ways peacefully.</i>

348
00:20:38,291 --> 00:20:40,791
Xiao Fan, why are you here?

349
00:20:40,791 --> 00:20:42,916
Didn't you take a week off?

350
00:20:42,916 --> 00:20:44,500
Didn't you say before

351
00:20:44,500 --> 00:20:47,083
that you wanted to send a salesman to Lin Gang?

352
00:20:47,083 --> 00:20:49,083
Yes, that's right.

353
00:20:51,208 --> 00:20:52,375
Let me tell you, Xiao Fan.

354
00:20:52,375 --> 00:20:53,750
The conditions there are terrible.

355
00:20:53,750 --> 00:20:55,208
There's no room for promotion.

356
00:20:55,208 --> 00:20:56,916
Don't let your friend get into that mess.

357
00:20:56,916 --> 00:20:58,208
No.

358
00:20:58,208 --> 00:21:02,259
I want to go myself.

359
00:21:02,259 --> 00:21:03,289
What?

360
00:21:03,289 --> 00:21:05,955
You're giving up an office job
to do field work?

361
00:21:08,208 --> 00:21:10,375
That's a voluntary demotion.

362
00:21:10,375 --> 00:21:12,333
There's no precedent for this
in our department.

363
00:21:12,333 --> 00:21:14,041
I'll write the report myself.

364
00:21:14,041 --> 00:21:15,541
If there are any issues,

365
00:21:15,541 --> 00:21:18,041
it won't have anything to do with you.

366
00:21:18,041 --> 00:21:20,875
Xiao Fan, you should think it over.

367
00:21:20,875 --> 00:21:23,166
Let's get this straight.

368
00:21:23,166 --> 00:21:25,541
If you leave and want to come back,

369
00:21:25,541 --> 00:21:27,625
it won't be up to me anymore.

370
00:21:27,625 --> 00:21:29,041
And...

371
00:21:30,208 --> 00:21:31,791
Go home and discuss it with your wife first

372
00:21:31,791 --> 00:21:33,041
before you submit the report to me.

373
00:21:33,041 --> 00:21:34,125
Okay.

374
00:21:34,125 --> 00:21:35,722
Thank you, Section Chief.

375
00:21:43,875 --> 00:21:45,166
<i>Xiao Fan.</i>

376
00:21:45,166 --> 00:21:46,584
<i>Dad wants to see you.</i>

377
00:21:51,249 --> 00:21:53,208
You've gone too far.

378
00:21:53,208 --> 00:21:57,708
What right do you have to belittle someone
who never criticized your past?

379
00:21:57,708 --> 00:22:00,583
Just apologize to Xiao Fan.

380
00:22:00,583 --> 00:22:04,791
Xiao Fan just needs a way to leave respectably.

381
00:22:04,791 --> 00:22:08,960
Make your apology.
Young couples don't hold grudges.

382
00:22:11,125 --> 00:22:15,033
Xiao Fan, come and sit.

383
00:22:20,125 --> 00:22:22,943
Sit down. Let's have a talk.

384
00:22:27,000 --> 00:22:30,041
We're having a family meeting today.

385
00:22:30,041 --> 00:22:33,934
First of all, I want to criticize Lv Xin.

386
00:22:34,667 --> 00:22:38,208
First, you were rude to your elders.

387
00:22:38,208 --> 00:22:41,208
Your parents-in-law are your parents, too.

388
00:22:41,208 --> 00:22:45,541
Who in the world
would kick out their own parents?

389
00:22:45,541 --> 00:22:50,031
Secondly, you didn't respect your husband.

390
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:55,625
It's also my fault for being too busy.

391
00:22:55,625 --> 00:22:59,125
Since your mother hasn't been around,

392
00:22:59,125 --> 00:23:01,750
I've been too lenient with you.

393
00:23:01,750 --> 00:23:05,416
Regarding this, I'll criticize myself as well.

394
00:23:05,416 --> 00:23:06,750
Dad.

395
00:23:06,750 --> 00:23:08,562
This has nothing to do with you.

396
00:23:09,375 --> 00:23:12,666
I didn't ask for a divorce
because I resent Lv Xin.

397
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:16,583
Then why do you want to divorce Lv Xin?

398
00:23:22,416 --> 00:23:24,750
Actually, I've thought about it.

399
00:23:24,750 --> 00:23:26,791
Lv Xin was right.

400
00:23:27,958 --> 00:23:30,125
I really don't deserve her.

401
00:23:30,125 --> 00:23:34,125
In terms of education, looks, or ability,

402
00:23:34,125 --> 00:23:35,973
I'm good for nothing.

403
00:23:37,875 --> 00:23:40,681
I don't want to waste her time anymore.

404
00:23:41,778 --> 00:23:44,439
I'm also grateful for all the help

405
00:23:45,791 --> 00:23:47,850
you've given me over the years.

406
00:23:49,208 --> 00:23:52,750
I just don't want to trouble you anymore.

407
00:23:52,750 --> 00:23:55,416
Does... your mother know about this?

408
00:23:57,583 --> 00:23:59,625
They don't know.

409
00:23:59,625 --> 00:24:01,166
This is my decision alone.

410
00:24:01,166 --> 00:24:03,166
Discuss it with your mother first.

411
00:24:03,166 --> 00:24:05,666
Listen to what your elders have to say.

412
00:24:05,666 --> 00:24:06,931
Dad.

413
00:24:07,708 --> 00:24:12,125
I married Lv Xin
because I followed my elders' advice.

414
00:24:12,125 --> 00:24:13,666
This time...

415
00:24:13,666 --> 00:24:15,271
Just let it go.

416
00:24:16,416 --> 00:24:18,708
If he wants a divorce, so be it.

417
00:24:18,708 --> 00:24:21,071
I don't care about Lu Xiao Fan.

418
00:24:32,291 --> 00:24:33,416
Dad.

419
00:24:33,416 --> 00:24:35,490
I'm going back to my room.

420
00:24:38,416 --> 00:24:40,000
Big Bro.

421
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:42,041
Can you come here for a moment?

422
00:24:42,041 --> 00:24:43,955
I have some things to give you.

423
00:24:51,083 --> 00:24:52,458
In here...

424
00:24:53,375 --> 00:24:56,041
is the scarf you brought me from France.

425
00:24:56,708 --> 00:24:59,074
And the CD player you gave me.

426
00:25:00,854 --> 00:25:02,984
Oh, right.

427
00:25:16,500 --> 00:25:18,578
And this.

428
00:25:21,416 --> 00:25:22,975
Big Bro.

429
00:25:24,083 --> 00:25:26,291
Since I'm divorcing Lv Xin,

430
00:25:30,000 --> 00:25:32,625
I won't be needing such nice things.

431
00:25:35,875 --> 00:25:37,291
I see.

432
00:25:38,416 --> 00:25:39,856
Lu Xiao Fan.

433
00:25:40,541 --> 00:25:42,917
You're not just divorcing Bei Lv Xin.

434
00:25:45,541 --> 00:25:48,723
You're trying to cut ties
with the Bei family entirely.

435
00:25:52,333 --> 00:25:54,708
These things aren't worth much.

436
00:25:54,708 --> 00:25:56,083
If you don't want them,

437
00:25:56,083 --> 00:25:58,125
just find a trash can and throw them away.

438
00:26:12,750 --> 00:26:13,958
Xiao Fan.

439
00:26:13,958 --> 00:26:17,823
Regarding your divorce, I don't agree with it.

440
00:26:18,875 --> 00:26:22,491
If you want to live apart
for a while, that's fine.

441
00:26:23,092 --> 00:26:25,916
It'll give everyone a chance to cool off.

442
00:26:25,916 --> 00:26:29,220
Once everyone has calmed down,
we'll talk again.

443
00:26:34,375 --> 00:26:37,583
Mr. Bei, I'll be going now.

444
00:27:00,542 --> 00:27:04,143
<i>Lin Gang? The climate is similar to Yunjing.</i>

445
00:27:04,143 --> 00:27:06,081
<i>Your lips get chapped easily.</i>

446
00:27:06,081 --> 00:27:08,072
<i>Make soup for yourself.</i>

447
00:27:20,107 --> 00:27:24,249
[Lin Gang, 1995]

448
00:27:35,208 --> 00:27:37,083
Could he be some rich kid

449
00:27:37,083 --> 00:27:39,125
coming here just to pad his resume?

450
00:27:39,125 --> 00:27:41,833
He volunteered to transfer from Yunjing.

451
00:27:41,833 --> 00:27:43,166
Maybe he got into some trouble.

452
00:27:43,166 --> 00:27:44,333
Then it's none of our business.

453
00:27:44,333 --> 00:27:47,208
The thing is,
our section chief is about to retire.

454
00:27:47,208 --> 00:27:48,625
At a time like this,

455
00:27:48,625 --> 00:27:52,156
someone with connections
from the head office drops in out of nowhere.

456
00:27:53,541 --> 00:27:56,916
Wang, is he here to take your promotion?

457
00:27:56,916 --> 00:27:57,958
Don't talk nonsense.

458
00:27:57,958 --> 00:28:00,791
Even if the chief retires,
it might not be my turn.

459
00:28:00,791 --> 00:28:03,166
But I looked into this Lu Xiao Fan.

460
00:28:03,166 --> 00:28:05,495
Apparently, he's some live-in son-in-law.

461
00:28:06,375 --> 00:28:07,750
That's enough.

462
00:28:07,750 --> 00:28:10,583
If you have time to gossip,
focus on your own work first.

463
00:28:10,583 --> 00:28:14,083
Our department's performance
has been at the bottom for six months straight.

464
00:28:14,083 --> 00:28:16,125
At this rate, forget about promotions.

465
00:28:16,125 --> 00:28:18,187
We'll be lucky to even keep our jobs.

466
00:28:19,208 --> 00:28:21,625
Ms. Xu, what do you mean by that?

467
00:28:21,625 --> 00:28:24,083
- You're even interested in a live-in husband?
- Exactly.

468
00:28:24,083 --> 00:28:26,000
All right. Be professional
during working hours.

469
00:28:26,000 --> 00:28:27,554
Get back to work.

470
00:29:02,000 --> 00:29:03,625
<i>Only after Lu Xiao Fan arrived in Lin Gang</i>

471
00:29:03,625 --> 00:29:06,416
<i>did his new life truly begin.</i>

472
00:29:06,416 --> 00:29:08,208
<i>He sat in the office every day,</i>

473
00:29:08,208 --> 00:29:10,583
<i>reporting any news back to the company.</i>

474
00:29:10,583 --> 00:29:13,708
<i>Actually, there wasn't much to do.</i>

475
00:29:13,708 --> 00:29:15,208
<i>The spring of 1995</i>

476
00:29:15,208 --> 00:29:17,541
<i>was the year of the stock market craze.</i>

477
00:29:18,333 --> 00:29:21,208
<i>He'd flip through
securities newspapers in his spare time,</i>

478
00:29:21,208 --> 00:29:22,750
<i>planning to open an account</i>

479
00:29:22,750 --> 00:29:25,833
<i>at Langjian Securities after work,</i>

480
00:29:25,833 --> 00:29:28,457
<i>in a bid to keep up with the times.</i>

481
00:29:28,457 --> 00:29:29,458
Hello.

482
00:29:29,458 --> 00:29:31,754
Hello, I'm here to open an account.

483
00:29:37,958 --> 00:29:39,416
Isn't this Xiao Fan?

484
00:29:39,416 --> 00:29:42,047
Xiao Fan! Xiao Fan!

485
00:29:48,375 --> 00:29:49,875
And this is...

486
00:29:49,875 --> 00:29:51,916
This is Lv Xin's husband.

487
00:29:51,916 --> 00:29:53,416
Let me introduce you.

488
00:29:53,416 --> 00:29:56,375
This is the General Manager
of Langjian, Lu Tao.

489
00:29:56,375 --> 00:29:58,375
He shares your surname. Get to know him.

490
00:29:58,375 --> 00:30:00,041
I was wondering why I heard

491
00:30:00,041 --> 00:30:02,039
magpies chirping when I left today.

492
00:30:03,083 --> 00:30:04,126
Lu Tao.

493
00:30:04,126 --> 00:30:05,291
Oh.

494
00:30:05,291 --> 00:30:06,416
Nice to meet you.

495
00:30:06,416 --> 00:30:08,833
Open a VIP room for him.

496
00:30:08,833 --> 00:30:10,529
No, that's really not necessary.

497
00:30:11,208 --> 00:30:12,375
Of course.

498
00:30:12,375 --> 00:30:15,166
Otherwise, we couldn't face Lv Qing.

499
00:30:15,166 --> 00:30:16,416
Really, there's no need.

500
00:30:16,416 --> 00:30:17,833
Zi Yang, Mr. Lu,

501
00:30:17,833 --> 00:30:19,973
I have something to do, I'll head off first.

502
00:30:26,166 --> 00:30:28,291
You're not joking with me, are you?

503
00:30:28,291 --> 00:30:29,935
Bei Lv Qing's brother-in-law?

504
00:30:30,958 --> 00:30:32,041
With Bei Lv Qing's status,

505
00:30:32,041 --> 00:30:35,000
how could his sister marry such a nobody?

506
00:30:35,000 --> 00:30:37,500
I'd be a dog if I lied to you.

507
00:30:37,500 --> 00:30:39,000
And let me tell you,

508
00:30:39,000 --> 00:30:41,708
he has a lot of influence over Lv Qing.

509
00:30:41,708 --> 00:30:44,708
If you want to get Lv Qing into Langjian,

510
00:30:44,708 --> 00:30:46,750
you should get him on board first.

511
00:30:46,750 --> 00:30:47,958
Trust me.

512
00:30:47,958 --> 00:30:50,750
It's not just effective, it's also fast.

513
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:52,750
That's unbelievable.

514
00:30:52,750 --> 00:30:55,208
I always thought someone like Bei Lv Qing

515
00:30:55,208 --> 00:30:57,610
wouldn't have anyone

516
00:30:58,708 --> 00:31:00,447
who could influence him.

517
00:31:02,083 --> 00:31:03,393
Don't worry.

518
00:31:04,208 --> 00:31:08,375
When we profit, I won't forget you.

519
00:31:08,375 --> 00:31:09,625
It's a small matter.

520
00:31:09,625 --> 00:31:12,250
Why are we brothers keeping score?

521
00:31:12,250 --> 00:31:14,166
We're in the securities business.

522
00:31:14,166 --> 00:31:15,958
Keeping score is what we do best.

523
00:31:15,958 --> 00:31:17,227
Come on.

524
00:31:27,541 --> 00:31:30,046
Lu Xiao Fan, it's your brother.

525
00:31:40,541 --> 00:31:41,708
<i>I'm calling to let you know,</i>

526
00:31:41,708 --> 00:31:43,458
<i>Mom spoke with old Mr. Bei.</i>

527
00:31:43,458 --> 00:31:45,500
<i>Everyone agrees that this divorce
is out of the question.</i>

528
00:31:45,500 --> 00:31:48,083
<i>Can't you use your head, Lu Xiao Fan?</i>

529
00:31:48,083 --> 00:31:50,708
<i>Don't you think about your family at all?</i>

530
00:31:50,708 --> 00:31:52,750
<i>Mom's blood pressure is so high
she can't even get out of bed.</i>

531
00:31:52,750 --> 00:31:54,291
<i>I'm telling you, stop making a scene.</i>

532
00:31:54,291 --> 00:31:56,500
<i>Just come back as soon as possible.</i>

533
00:31:56,500 --> 00:31:58,125
I'm not going back.

534
00:31:58,125 --> 00:31:59,832
<i>Do you want to kill Mom with anger?</i>

535
00:31:59,832 --> 00:32:01,041
<i>That's enough.</i>

536
00:32:01,041 --> 00:32:02,375
<i>I'm going to Lin Gang in a couple of days.</i>

537
00:32:02,375 --> 00:32:04,047
<i>We'll talk in person.</i>

